- Bits 52-62 (bits 20-30 of i0) represent the exponent (biased by 0x3ff or 1023)
- Bit 63 (bit 31 of i0) represents the sign

The calculation ((i0>>20)&0x7ff)-0x3ff extracts the exponent and removes the bias, giving the actual exponent value.

